---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import MediaPlaceholder from '../../components/MediaPlaceholder.astro';
---
<Layout title="Meet Poji">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container hero hero--split">
      <div>
        <h1>Meet Poji</h1>
        <p>Poji is Aya's little lion doll — the little lion who turns up throughout Aya and Sura's adventures. To the people around Aya and Sura, Poji is a doll. Within the storytelling world, Poji can still carry personality, humor and emotional meaning without changing that rule.</p>
      </div>
      <MediaPlaceholder label="CHARACTER — Poji approved art" ratio="portrait" variant={3} />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--surface">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Small lion. Big opinions.</h2>
      <p>To everyone else, Poji is exactly what he looks like: a stuffed lion. But in the stories, Poji has plenty to say about what's happening — and usually considers himself the most qualified member of the group.</p>
      <div class="grid grid-2" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">
        <div class="card"><h3>Poji likes</h3><p class="muted">Being included, comfortable places, and being right.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>Poji dislikes</h3><p class="muted">Being ignored and questionable plans.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--soft">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Find Poji</h2>
      <p class="muted">Poji appears in story scenes, coloring pages and activities throughout Aya and Sura's world, including the monthly Adventure Club.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/adventure-club/">See the Adventure Club</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
